{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15996","headline":"伤韦令孔雀词 · 王建","name":"伤韦令孔雀词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜孔雀初得时，美人爲尔别开池。\n池边凤凰作伴侣，羌声鹦鹉无言语。\n雕笼玉架嫌不栖，夜夜思归向南舞。\n如今憔悴人见恶，万里更求新孔雀。\n热眠雨水饥拾虫，翠尾盘泥金彩落。\n多时人养不解飞，海山风黑何处归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}